  The text describes a *specific application* of navigability in the context of graph-based algorithms for approximate nearest neighbor search (ANN). While it references prior work (e.g., [47]), the authors add concrete implementation details (e.g., "by following a sequence of locally greedy steps") and contextualizes how navigability enables the algorithm to function. This constitutes 20% of the value as original, actionable insight.
  
